{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33606","headline":"送杜仓曹往沧洲觐叔常侍 · 许棠","name":"送杜仓曹往沧洲觐叔常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮阳横巨浸，南巷拥旌旃。\n别带秦城雨，行闻魏国蝉。\n碛鸿来每後，朝日见常先。\n东鄙云霞广，高林间水天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}